  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "It would be helpful to have a \"Visited\" mark displayed next to instance IDs in the instance list of a world.\n\nPopular worlds often have multiple public instances. This feature would be useful when you want to visit another instance and experience something different. Moreover, if VRChat client crashes while you're communicating with someone who isn't yet a friend, knowing which instance you were in would make it much easier to rejoin them. Currently, it's a hassle to either manually remember the instance IDs or dig through logs.\n\nThe duration for resetting the \"Visited\" mark would need consideration, but I personally think around 3 hours would be fine.",
